pomptty (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Paste no longer runs on its own: a trailing newline is stripped from
    every paste, and the multi-line confirm dialog now covers
    bracketed-paste shells too.
  * Command palette: "Help: About pomptty" dialog (version / repository /
    license).

